  <!-- EN: alienism -->
  <AM_Structure_Alienism.label>异域生命崇拜</AM_Structure_Alienism.label>
  <!-- EN: "True" alien life might not have been encountered by humanity, but we have warped life so much that the distinction is moot. Only by embracing this can we reach the truth. -->
  <AM_Structure_Alienism.description>人类或许从未遇见过“真正的”异域生命。不过，我们对生命的扭曲也早已使辨别它们这件事失去了意义。唯有彻底接纳这一点，我们才能触及到宇宙的真理。</AM_Structure_Alienism.description>
