  <!-- EN: atheism -->
  <AM_Structure_Atheist.label>广义无神论</AM_Structure_Atheist.label>
  <!-- EN: There are no gods, no supernatural beings guiding our path or watching over us. Unfalsifiable concepts cannot be used as a basis for a rational society. -->
  <AM_Structure_Atheist.description>这个世界根本没有守护并引导我们的神明或超自然存在。自圆其说的虚伪概念无法成为构建理性社会的基石。</AM_Structure_Atheist.description>
