  <!-- EN: The misguided romanticization of ages long past has been a constant through all human history. Even though the modern pirates on the Rim have nothing to do with ancient seafaring pirates the corsair aesthetics have perdured well into the space age. -->
  <AM_Structure_Corsair.description>纵览古今，人类总喜欢将某些事物过度浪漫化。虽然边缘世界上的现代太空海盗和古时候的海盗毫不相干，但他们所秉承的那种海盗审美理念却出人意料地被延续至今。</AM_Structure_Corsair.description>
