  <!-- EN: neolithic -->
  <AM_Structure_Neolithic.label>石器部落</AM_Structure_Neolithic.label>
  <!-- EN: The vast gulfs of space and time between the stars leave individual worlds vulnerable to regression. This culture has fallen from grace entirely, and reverted to stone-age, prehistoric levels of technological advancement and refinement.\n\n<color=#E5E54C>Gameplay effect:</color>\n - Bear in mind that this structure is NOT a technology locker in ANY way. This culture has kept the style of their stone age origins, but they can make weapons, build a spaceship, etc. Use a different mod to lock research to certain tech levels. -->
  <AM_Structure_Neolithic.description>由于超光速技术仍是人类难以逾越的一大难关，因此行星之间的时空障壁很容易使某些世界重归原始。不过，偶尔体验一下这种石器部落的蛮古生活又有何妨呢？\n\n&lt;color=#E5E54C>游戏效果：&lt;/color>\n请注意，此文化结构并不会以任何方式锁定你的技术等级。你可以在体验石器时代风格的同时制作枪械以及建造飞船，这两者显然并不冲突，对吧？</AM_Structure_Neolithic.description>
