  <!-- EN: scavenger -->
  <AM_Structure_Scavenger.label>遗墟拾荒</AM_Structure_Scavenger.label>
  <!-- EN: The refuse and discarded ancient technology of past civilizations can be easily recycled and repurposed. Why would be toil endlessly to create things from scratch, when we can make use of what is already there?\n\n<color=#E5E54C>Gameplay effect:</color>\n - This structure (and associated style) make the Scrapper meme easier to use, allowing the player to just build things that count for the Scrapper meme. -->
  <AM_Structure_Scavenger.description>过往文明遗留下来的残骸与远古科技很容易就能变废为宝。既然我们有能力回收并再利用这些物品，那为什么还要费心费力地从头开始制作呢？\n\n&lt;color=#E5E54C>游戏效果：&lt;/color>\n此文化结构是为了改善“节俭主义”模因的体验而设计的，你可以借此建造一些更实用且更有代入感的建筑。</AM_Structure_Scavenger.description>
